# THE AUTHORED SPRITE SHEETS STAY OUT OF GIT. Josh's call, 2026-09-12:
# "keep any SS sheets uncommitted including the kid sheets". They are ~1.5GB
# of source art; what the game loads is the built atlases under
# game/assets/sprites, and tools/prep_sprites.py rebuilds those from a local
# copy of the sheets. The LFS rule in .gitattributes only ever matched the
# top level, so animations/kids/ (208MB) would have gone in as plain blobs.
animations/SS_*.png
animations/kids/SS_*.png
